HAH, serious or not, that's awesome. I like how it gives examples of
centiLindars, explains what you might expect for doing something that's 1
full Lindar, but completely leaves to the imagination just what a
kiloLindar might be and just what kind of reaction it would get ;)

Maybe "the aristocrats" jokes could be measured in terms of decaLindars or
even hectoLindars for the really good ones.

